{
 "_about": "v65: the special-law codes (src/rag/special_laws.py) a case admits only with their domain signal in the first read (its facts, goal, hypotheses, parties, alternatives): an article of one of them is no candidate, and none of their computed term lines is shown, unless the signal is there or the user names the article. code: a regular expression on the row's code or document name; signal: one expression that must match, or signal_all: every expression must match (the consumer code: a professional seller AND a consumer). The list and the expressions are Code's draft; the corpus' document names are to be checked on the server. v75: a regulation (Reg. / Regolamento (UE) nn/yyyy) needs an entry of its own -- its own domain signal, never the sector's (DORA: ICT risk, not «banca»); a regulation with no entry never reaches grading unless the user names it (special_laws.gate). v75b: the store's other regulations -- Reg. 692/2014, Direttiva 94/25/CE, the Regolamento generale and the Provvedimento 2022/1917 of the Banca d'Italia -- each with its own signal. v79.9 (Block C): every law carries its «family» (and, where known, «number»/«year»: a document named «… n. 385» of 1993 is the TUB). The family gate (src/rag/family_gate.py) admits a document only by its family: the codes always; the defaults (strada, stupefacenti, mediazione, consumo with a professional counterparty); a family law with its signal; an active module's laws (data/corpus_expected.json); a law the user names. New entries: antiriciclaggio, the privacy code, the insurance code, the schools TU, the nautica code, the public contracts code, the Banca d'Italia circulars. v79.10 (A4): «families» -- a family's own signal, shared by its laws: «strong» (one expression suffices) or «weak» (at least «weak_min» of them, default 2, each a different expression): «il Comune», «la PA» or a bare «provvedimento» alone never admit an administrative law (a 2051 custodia case naming the Comune as the road's custodian stays civil). A law without «signal»/«signal_all» whose family has a «families» entry takes the family's signal; «signal_families» adds a family's signal to a law's own (the TU edilizia keeps its family «edilizia» and its own signal -- private building works, appalto -- and is admitted by the amministrativo signal too). New entry: L. 241/1990 (family amministrativo). v79.10 (A4, archive names): an entry matched to the archive by its documents' exact names -- «expected» (the data/corpus_expected.json law it is: its «archive_names») or its own «archive_names» (the d.lgs. 81/2008, «Testo Unico sulla Sicurezza del Lavoro 2026»; the d.lgs. 231/2001, «Responsabilità Amministrativa di Società ed Enti 2026») -- is found on a row's code or document name only by those names (whitespace-normalised equality) or by its own citation («d.P.R. 309/1990», the whole text); its «code» expression and number/year read the user's words only. The other entries match as before.",
